# LariPay / Fintech Pay — Agent Context

**Read first:** `AGENTS.md` at repo root (full handbook from prior sessions).

## What this project is

Georgian payment gateway SaaS (**LariPay.ai**) — Stripe-like for GEL via TBC, BOG, Liberty, Credo, Cartu, Basis, Flitt. Main app: `integrations/shopify/georgia-pay-app/`. Production: **https://laripay.vercel.app**.

## Current focus

- **Active:** WooCommerce plugin (`integrations/wordpress/georgia-pay/`) + Direct API
- **Paused:** Shopify Payments extension (invitation-only platform)
- **Test mode:** Simulated payments at `/payment/test` — real bank APIs not fully live

## WooCommerce plugin v1.0.4 essentials

- ZIP: `integrations/shopify/georgia-pay-app/integration-packages/georgia-pay.zip`
- Return URL uses `?laripay=success|failed` → `Georgia_Pay_Return_Handler` auto-sets **Completed** / **Failed**
- Customer **chooses bank** at checkout (`georgia_pay_bank`) and on test payment page (`POST /api/payment/set-bank`)
- Webhook: `?wc-api=georgia_pay_laripay` (local sites won't receive it — return URL is primary for local test)
- Validate: `php integrations/wordpress/test-plugin.php`

## Key paths

| Area | Path |
|------|------|
| Checkout API | `lib/laripay/checkout.ts` |
| Finalize + redirect | `lib/laripay/finalize.ts`, `lib/laripay/redirect-result.ts` |
| Test page | `app/payment/test/page.tsx` |
| WC gateway | `integrations/wordpress/georgia-pay/includes/class-wc-georgia-pay-gateway.php` |
| Return handler | `integrations/wordpress/georgia-pay/includes/class-georgia-pay-return-handler.php` |

## Deploy

```bash
cd integrations/shopify/georgia-pay-app && npx vercel --prod --yes
node scripts/build-integration-packages.mjs  # rebuild plugin ZIP locally
```

## User preferences (Georgian market)

- Auto payment confirmation — **no manual order status edits**
- Instant success/failure UI — not "processing…"
- Simple merchant onboarding; rejected email payment links as main flow
- User writes in Georgian; support ka + en copy

## Pitfalls

- Blocks support: `protected $settings`, load blocks class only on `woocommerce_blocks_loaded`
- Never commit secrets; don't commit unless user asks
- Legacy `payka_*` naming still supported alongside `laripay_*`
